+ * The only relation names this module understands: the four navigation
+ * relations GitHub's releases endpoint emits, compared case-insensitively as
+ * registered names are. This is deliberately not a general RFC 8288 client.
+ * Any other relation, including a well-formed registered name or extension
+ * URI, is refused rather than parsed, so a `Link` field the module does not
+ * fully understand can never pass for the end of the listing.
+ */
